    "description": "Commons (level 1), level 2 of 3: L1 plus flourish 2. A round paved plaza 13 across, level with the grass, at a road junction: a statue of the king on a stepped plinth in the middle, ringed paving, gravel spokes, planters; later levels add the statue, benches, lanterns, a notice board, banners and a market stall. Not yet builder-tested: chiseled_stone_bricks, light_weighted_pressure_plate, polished_andesite, red_banner, red_wool, stone_brick_wall. Decoration step adds: sign_text.",
    "changes": "Level 1 is no longer bare: the benches facing the plinth, the lantern posts, poppies in the planters and the plaque come at level 1 now (the statue still arrives at level 2). The lone bushes on the lawn at level 3 are gone.",
